        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1440] If the EVCC wants to continue the energy transfer and received the AC_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\", the EVCC shall send another AC_ChargeLoopReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 216.",
