        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1443] If the EVCC wants to stop the energy transfer and received the AC_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = OK, the EVCC shall send a PowerDeliveryReq with ChargeProgress = \"Stop\" within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
