        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2193] If the EVCC wants to enter a standby phase and received the AC_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = OK, the EVCC shall send a PowerDeliveryReq with ChargeProgress = \"Standby\" within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
            "block_bbox": [
