        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1969] If the first ServiceDiscoveryRes message of the service session had the parameter ServiceRenegotiationSupported set to \"True\" and the EVCC decided to perform a ServiceRenegotiation for adapting its service selection, the EVCC shall send a PowerDeliveryReq with parameter ChargeProgress set to \"Stop\" after AC_ChargeLoopRes has been received while V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Timer is smaller than V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Time.",
            "block_bbox": [
